Phase 5 offline acceptance continuation, 2026-10-04 UTC. No live Broker contacted. Bilingual Plan 06 gate text was restored to its original acceptance criteria after verifying that the previous per-method-coverage warning was stale; neither plan is modified in the resulting worktree.
Rust tests: 4fc8dcb adds expired-deadline checks for all exposed oneway facade variants and verifies that an unsolicited oneway response cannot satisfy the next synchronous offset query. Prior 19c8c44 covers scripted domain outcomes, d71609b covers every Broker method with one-attempt observation, and existing route cases cover failover and shared deadlines. Observation windows and the delayed reply scheduling are bounded, not proof of every possible interleaving.
