Validation: cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-core --test rpc --locked PASS (9); cargo test --workspace --locked PASS; cargo fmt --all -- --check PASS; cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets --all-features --locked -- -D warnings PASS; mvn -q -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml verify PASS; compat/java-reference/run-rpc-differential.sh PASS (15 frames). Maven/fixture commands print fastjson2 sun.misc.Unsafe deprecation warnings.
Acceptance inventory: P5-V01 remains unchecked pending complete method/branch/applicability audit including success-with-no-body cases. P5-V03 remains unchecked pending deterministic pending-state/deadline proof across oneway paths beyond finite observation, while per-method attempt tests now exist. P5-U01 remains unchecked: no invoked evidence yet for every send variant, end transaction, consumer list, heartbeat V2, assignment, Lite subscription, batch ACK, and async callback success/error branches; Java 5.5.1 has no MQClientAPIImpl Lite subscription method, so this mapping requires a separate source-level decision. Rust Future awaiting a response differs from Java async callback dispatch. P5-V02 is deferred to Phase 19 as specified. Phase 5 is not accepted.